   421	        /* Message format: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc1035
   422	
   423	        +---------------------+
   424	    |        Header       |
   425	    +---------------------+
   426	    |       Question      | the question for the name server
   427	    +---------------------+
   428	    |        Answer       | RRs answering the question
   429	    +---------------------+
   430	    |      Authority      | RRs pointing toward an authority
   431	    +---------------------+
   432	    |      Additional     | RRs holding additional information
   433	    +---------------------+
   434	    */
